# Public origin of a deployed static build, including kit.paths.base, no trailing slash.
# Include the scheme: https://host (a bare hostname is treated as https).
# Leave unset for localhost / a raw folder — sharing tags stay relative.
# Must be present at `pnpm build` (Docker image build on Railway) so prerendered
# Open Graph / canonical tags are absolute. Current Railway host (will change):
# PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://learning-korean-production.up.railway.app
